# Copy this file to ".env" (it is ignored by git) and fill in your own value.
# Restart `npm run dev` after changing it. On Vercel, add the same name under
# Project Settings -> Environment Variables and redeploy.
#
# PUBLIC values only. Anything starting with VITE_ is copied into the web page,
# so anyone can read it. A Google OAuth client ID is meant to be public.
# NEVER put a client secret, an Instagram token or any password here.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
